  "ruleText": "Ph 906.04 Failure to Comply. Failure to comply with any of the provisions of Ph 906 shall result in non-renewal of the pharmacy permit.\n\nSource. #10663, eff 9-3-14; ss by #13244, eff 7-30-21",
